msgstr "{nbt}`int` **max**: 上限。"

#: ../../modules/random.md:116 78bab7cf06314ad0948ad01fe9df3f08
msgid "**Return | Score `$random.uniform bs.out`**: A random integer in range [`min`, `max`]."
msgstr "**返回值 | 分数 `$random.uniform bs.out`**：[`min`, `max`] 范围内的随机整数。"

